  "band_assertion": "Every vector with band human scores at or below consts.human_band_edge; every vector with band agent scores at or above consts.agent_evidence_edge. Both assertions are fixture-tested in both cores, so an AI agent driving genuine input is positive evidence and a human-band payload never escalates.",
